## Required sections (in order)

- Context & Goal
- Non-goals
- Acceptance criteria
- Artifacts (what to produce and where)
- Open questions / risks

## Writing standards

- Use task-oriented, testable acceptance criteria (bulleted, unambiguous).
- Link to relevant philosophies and prior decisions via relative paths.
- Include diagrams or examples where helpful (`mermaid`, `text` for flows).

## File naming

- Use kebab-case slugs: `design-specs/<kebab-slug>.md`.
- Keep filenames stable across iterations.

## Handoff readiness checklist

- [ ] All sections present and filled
- [ ] All links are relative and render on GitHub
- [ ] Acceptance criteria are testable and scoped
- [ ] Any open risks have clear next steps or owners
